          "description": "I Dream of You: HYMNS is a thoughtful collection of timeless hymns, reimagined with JJ Heller’s signature style. This album creates a peaceful and reflective atmosphere, perfect for moments of quiet reflection or heartfelt gratitude. Gentle arrangements and soothing vocals give a sense of serenity and connection, making this album a beautiful companion to your moments of introspection and inspiration.",
